{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This demo offers a glimpse into the mall \u2014 a fragment of the story within the larger experience of the full game. Play solo, or together with up to 2 friends.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.poster.avif?t=1758897842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.webm?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.mp4?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>1-3 co-op survival horror</strong>. Play as ordinary shoppers trapped in an endless store. Find the exit together at all costs before the employees catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal shopping complex inspired by SCP-3008 and <i>The Backrooms</i>. By day, lights flicker across deserted halls, inviting exploration. By night, employees roam the aisles looking to &quot;assist&quot; you. Silence, teamwork, and quick thinking are your only tools for survival.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/4672d73f8a37e113c1398bf155232e73.poster.avif?t=1758897842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/4672d73f8a37e113c1398bf155232e73.webm?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/4672d73f8a37e113c1398bf155232e73.mp4?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape Alone or With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to escape a store that doesn't want you to leave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your next move using proximity voice chat and walkie-talkies. Piece together environmental clues and decode cryptic notes to find your next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split up and look for whatever may help you escape. Search the mall for tools and items, and make sure you can slip away when danger comes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to unlock new paths, hopefully guiding you to an exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you cling to the shadows, letting madness creep in, or stay in the light where they\u2019re already watching you?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/112cb3e9cd1f528ee54c744a49d6dbd3.poster.avif?t=1758897842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/112cb3e9cd1f528ee54c744a49d6dbd3.webm?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/112cb3e9cd1f528ee54c744a49d6dbd3.mp4?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Stealth and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights go out, employees are on the look out for shoppers who need &quot;assistance&quot; after hours. Cut communications to stay silent, or risk getting caught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in vents, progress without making noise, use flashlights to fight the darkness but be careful as the batteries are limited. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the mall's traps and aberrations, they will gnaw at your mind until you can't trust what you see or do. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every error might lead the store's abominations straight to you. Find fuses to turn the lights back on and hopefully start a new day.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/741d8010c1a5c0dbf9f0d44b3d8967f0.poster.avif?t=1758897842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/741d8010c1a5c0dbf9f0d44b3d8967f0.webm?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/741d8010c1a5c0dbf9f0d44b3d8967f0.mp4?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice Chat: Hear the screams of your friends echoing from a different aisle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Store: Experience horror in a shopping complex inspired by SCP-3008 and The Backrooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walkie-Talkie: Use long-distance communication, beware of who might be listening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity System: The mall gets into your head. Lose control, and you may turn against your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D Audio: Enjoy the unnerving noises breaking the silence of this not-so-empty store.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.poster.avif?t=1758897842\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.webm?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.mp4?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011020?t=1758897842","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011020?t=1758897842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/3ff07ba9691588e6328ffec1d0da114673ac793f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758897842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/3ff07ba9691588e6328ffec1d0da114673ac793f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758897842","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This demo offers a glimpse into the mall \u2014 a fragment of the story within the larger experience of the full game. Play solo, or together with up to 2 friends.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.poster.avif?t=1758897842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c.webm?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/740e6b23098d0116bb4b3e055178584c