res</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice Chat: Hear the screams of your friends echoing from a different aisle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Store: Experience horror in a shopping complex inspired by SCP-3008 and The Backrooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walkie-Talkie: Use long-distance communication, beware of who might be listening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity System: The mall gets into your head. Lose control, and you may turn against your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D Audio: Enjoy the unnerving noises breaking the silence of this not-so-empty store.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.poster.avif?t=1758897842\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.webm?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/extras/dc5b6a0a492cfe397b2f43c4a635c2e1.mp4?t=1758897842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Embers"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3417410","name":"Storebound"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011020/16840debbc4daa54f389965f643a3bf4940dd088/header.jpg?t=1758897842","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\"SCP-3008\" by Mortos, from the SCP Wiki. Source: https://scpwiki.com/scp-3008. Licensed under CC-BY-SA.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContent relating to the SCP Foundation, including the SCP Foundation logo, is licensed under Creative Commons Sharea